<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n70852" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νῑκήφορ-ος</span></b> , 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νικᾱφ-</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φέρω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bringing victory,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίκη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ch.</u>
					148
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φέρομαι</span>) <i>bearing off the prize,
				victorious,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				1.116
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ν. ἀγλαΐα</span> the glory
				<i>of victory,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				13.14
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρᾶγμα ν.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Eu.</u>
					477
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κράτος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					186
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίκη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					781
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄγρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ba.</u>
					1200
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεὸς</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεοὶ ν.,</span> applied to the Ptolemies, <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				89.3
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PTeb.</u>
				43.28
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>; epith. of Athena, Eros, etc., <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				629.6
			</span></i> (Pergam., <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				11(4).1304
			</span></i> (Delos, <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>), etc.: c. gen., <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Mem.</u>
				3.4.5
			</span></i>.</div>
